The conditional sentence on this line is behavior the model consumes:
armed → *"...still running after Ns is also moved to a background job
automatically..."*; `Duration.zero` → absent ("the model must not be taught
the conversion it will never get", per the doc comment). The suite asserts
the runtime kill switch (`threshold 0 is the kill switch — the classic path
runs`) but never asserts either description branch. Two cheap assertions
close the gap:

